    },
    {
      "id": "note-1ef7ec1cfb31",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 09:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "昨天低點、大K線低點Long limit 拿單根K線Scalp",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T07:25:16.852084+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:25:16.852094+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-9409b583470a",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 09:55:00 EDT",
      "text": "拿到Scalp TP，看有沒有機會小TR BO",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T07:25:58.868837+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:25:58.868844+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-6fbb70a85252",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 09:58:00 EDT",
      "text": "小TR BO的話10點反轉有機會但收上影線等收破再看",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T07:26:38.730839+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:27:21.869043+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-242b09811e93",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 10:10:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊5m偏空操作但小心反轉最好用Limit order",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T07:28:07.584878+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:28:07.584885+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-97c7070a07af",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 10:15:00 EDT",
      "text": "有一個micro WBO 1m看起來還不錯嘗試拿10點大反轉",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T07:29:01.156976+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:29:01.156985+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-35c27e90cdbe",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 10:34:00 EDT",
      "text": "突破的不太乾脆但空方不強 應該可以拿到50%位置，至少拿1R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T07:30:43.766987+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:31:24.065045+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-9cf5e21afc82",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 10:55:00 EDT",
      "text": "拿到50%位置，這邊可能窄通道繼續往上等12點反轉 \n這邊有可能整天波幅大致上完成",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T07:32:37.515785+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:32:48.379705+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-13185593373d",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 11:14:00 EDT",
      "text": "拿到WBO 2R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T07:33:36.067856+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:33:36.067863+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-65fdca189385",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 11:59:00 EDT",
      "text": "TTR 等Bear Confirm Bar",
