      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T07:35:27.848500+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-f4c27821f8ec",
      "replay_time": "2026-09-08 12:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊可以嘗試抓12點反轉，收回去就停損",
